eturn { premium };                                         // binding 1\n```\nRough total: constants(1) + bindings(~10) + invocations(~9×2=18) + loop(5) ≈ **~34**\n\n### Step 3–4: Apply Rule 2 (Reveals Intent)\n\nThe refactoring makes first-insurance an explicit additive surcharge. Mass is essentially unchanged (Rule 2 trumps APP here — the win is clarity and correct composition semantics for future modifiers)."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01M99NRPhmKymzZzXBYsqTa2","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-2/src/claim-office.ts","edits":[{"oldText":"const PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\nconst FIRST_INSURANCE_MULTIPLIER = 1.1;","newText":"const PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\nconst FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE = 0.1;"},{"oldText":"  const basePremium = basePremiumForItems(step.items);\n  const itemSurcharges = step.items.reduce(\n    (sum, item) => sum + itemSurcharge(item),\n    0\n  );\n  const withFirstInsurance = basePremium * FIRST_INSURANCE_MULTIPLIER;\n  const premium =\n    Math.ceil(roundCents(withFirstInsurance + itemSurcharges)) + PROCESSING_FEE;\n  return { premium };","newText":"  const basePremium = basePremiumForItems(step.items);\n  const firstInsuranceSurcharge = basePremium * FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE;\n  const itemSurcharges = step.items.reduce(\n    (sum, item) => sum + itemSurcharge(item),\n    0\n  );\n  const modifiedPremium =\n    basePremium + firstInsuranceSurcharge + itemSurcharges;\n  const premium = Math.ceil(roundCents(modifiedPremium)) + PROCESSING_FEE;\n  return { premium };"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":5603,"output":2259,"cacheRead":9696,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":17558,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907473916,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-77523784-47f8-496e-a127-6af3fb55ed9a","respons