m`, `createPolicy`, `runScenario` — all clearly reveal intent. ✅\n- `quotePremiumForStep`, `insuranceValueForItem`, `itemSurcharge` — accurate. ✅\n\n**Decision:** All names accurately reveal intent. No renaming needed.\n\n### Step 2: Locate a concrete improvement\n\nLooking at `processClaim`:\n\n```ts\nconst rawPayout = sumBy(damages, (damage) => payoutForDamage(damage));\n```\n\nThis wraps `payoutForDamage` in a redundant arrow function. Since `payoutForDamage` already has the exact `(item) => number` shape that `sumBy` expects, the wrapper adds an unnecessary binding + invocation (Rule 4: Fewest Elements).\n\n### Step 2b: Initial APP Mass (of that expression)\n\n```\nsumBy(damages, (damage) => payoutForDamage(damage))\n- Bindings: damages, damage (arrow param)        = 2\n- Invocations: sumBy, payoutForDamage            = 2 x 2 = 4\nSubtotal for the callback construct: 6\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Rule 4 (Fewest Elements)\n\nThe arrow wrapper is a pure passthrough. Remove it."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01FpN9TrTxWtc6dvkoQZjgmm","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts","edits":[{"oldText":"  const rawPayout = sumBy(damages, (damage) => payoutForDamage(damage));","newText":"  const rawPayout = sumBy(damages, payoutForDamage);"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":8129,"output":1787,"cacheRead":10110,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":20026,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907974223,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-03bfc4b0-d5ed-4a4a-9d71-43cb80954bc9","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01FpN9TrTxWtc6dvkoQZjgmm","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in src/claim-office.ts."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n  82 \n  83 const processClaim = (step: Step, policies: Policy[]): StepResult => {\n  84   const policy =